4:/**
5: * recalculateEloChain DELETEs + REINSERTS elo_history_logs per user inside its
6: * match loop. Without a consent filter, one admin call re-scored every completed
7: * match — including ones whose players never consented — silently voiding the
8: * enqueue and apply gates.
9: *
10: * These drive the real loop and assert on the destructive call itself. A spy on a
11: * helper, or a source-text check, could pass while the gate was wired to the wrong
12: * place or computed from rows the loop never loads.
13: */
14:describe('recalculateEloChain consent gate', () => {
